abstract: >-
  Independent evaluation of Jev-compatible TypeSafe System One decision models
  in Traditional Chinese (zh-TW), using Plumb-4B through Ollama /v1/systemone.
  The archive includes historical aggregate results, MASSIVE and original
  synthetic fixtures, a portable CLI, reproduction procedures, and adversarial
  testing of prompt injection, wording sensitivity, and confident errors.
  Findings support workflow-calibrated assistance and routing, with human
  confirmation or deterministic rules for high-risk actions.
  Code is MIT; original documents, aggregate results, and synthetic fixtures
  are CC BY 4.0; upstream datasets and model weights retain their own licenses.
